@startuml
title ASII-05 - Casos de uso del flujo de citas medicas

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Personal administrativo" as Admin
actor "Paciente" as Paciente
actor "Medico" as Medico

rectangle "Micro-HIS - Citas medicas y agenda" {
  usecase "Solicitar cita" as UC1
  usecase "Confirmar cita" as UC2
  usecase "Cancelar cita" as UC3
  usecase "Validar reglas de la cita" as UC4
  usecase "Verificar disponibilidad" as UC5
}

Paciente --> UC1
Admin --> UC1
Admin --> UC2
Admin --> UC3

UC1 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
UC1 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC2 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
UC3 ..> UC4 : <<include>>

UC5 --> Medico

note bottom of UC5
Dos comprobaciones:
- jornada laboral del medico
- ausencia de cruce con citas
  pendientes o confirmadas
end note

note bottom of UC2
No vuelve a verificar disponibilidad.
Solo valida la transicion de estado.
end note

note right of UC4
Fecha futura, duracion positiva,
paciente y medico obligatorios,
transicion de estado permitida.
end note

@enduml
